{"version":1,"key":"card:198","content":{"id":198,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"DOM 定义了一个 Node 类型的接口，DOM 树上的节点都实现了该类型，因此所有的节点都有着 Node 接口中规定的属性和方法。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然 HTML 元素以及文本内容都会被转化为节点，但是明显 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"document","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 节点，HTML 元素节点，以及文本节点等等它们之间的地位是不一样的，这意味着虽然大家都是 Node 类型的对象，但是却有着不同，每个节点都有着自己的类型，而 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nodeType","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性正是用来表明节点类型的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"nodeType","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值为数字类型，根据 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nodeType","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的值不同，节点类型分为 12 种，如下"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Node.ELEMENT_NODE(1)","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Node.ATTRIBUTE_NODE(2)","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Node.TEXT_NODE(3)","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Node.CDATA_SECTION_NODE(4)","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Node.ENTITY_REFERENCE_NODE(5)","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Node.ENTITY_NODE(6)","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Node.PROCESSING_NODE(7)","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Node.COMMENT_NODE(8)","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Node.DOCUMENT_NODE(9)","code":tr